<title>BAHRAIN: Britain's Debenhams opens Bahrain store.</title>
<headline>Britain's Debenhams opens Bahrain store.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British department store chain Debenhams, part of the Burton Group, on Wednesday said it had opened a store at a Bahrain shopping mall.</p>
<p>&quot;We chose Bahrain as the location for this outlet because we viewed it as a key country at the hub of business in the Gulf,&quot; a company statement said.</p>
